! Generated by `gpuwm domain --source hrrr`.  This is the native gpuwm half of the pair;
! the two differ only by ra_lw_physics 0->1 (native longwave off only), use_theta_m 0->1, stock-only ghg_input=0, stock-only do_radar_ref=1, which the HRRR hierarchy
! route verifies key for key before it prepares anything.
